  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Opt-in query projection: ProjectMapped on IQueryable, plus GetProjection, TryGetProjection and AssertProjectionIsValid through the new IProjectionMapper interface, turn a registered map into a translatable Select expression (convention, MapFrom inlined, Ignore, NullSubstitute, conversions, nested maps, collection members, constructor-bound destinations). A map that cannot be projected throws one InvalidOperationException listing every offending member; a cyclic type graph is rejected with a hint to Ignore. Existing mapping behaviour is unchanged.",
